# Integer16 power within range

Verifies int16 exponentiation with base and exponent chosen to stay inside
the 16-bit range through the complete CLI pipeline. Both operands are int16
to keep this case focused on same-type power semantics.

>>> source
const base: int16 = 2
const exponent: int16 = 14

const power: int16 = base ** exponent
print(power)

<<< stdout
16384

<<< stderr
